CHANGE 6 — PERSISTENT NATIVE UPGRADE STRIP
============================================

This is a native SwiftUI view (NOT an AdMob banner) that appears for free
users at all times. It keeps Pro on the user's radar even when no ad is
showing — the highest driver of eventual conversion.

6a. Create a reusable component.
    Add this struct to a new file: AITest/Views/Components/ProUpgradeStrip.swift

    import SwiftUI

    struct ProUpgradeStrip: View {
        let onTap: () -> Void

        var body: some View {
            Button(action: onTap) {
                HStack(spacing: 8) {
                    Image(systemName: "sparkles")
                        .font(.system(size: 12, weight: .semibold))
                        .foregroundColor(Color(red: 0.051, green: 0.580, blue: 0.533))
                    Text("Go Pro — Remove Ads & Unlock Everything")
                        .font(.system(size: 12, weight: .medium))
                        .foregroundColor(.primary)
                    Spacer()
                    Text("See Plans")
                        .font(.system(size: 11, weight: .semibold))
                        .foregroundColor(.white)
                        .padding(.horizontal, 10)
                        .padding(.vertical, 4)
                        .background(Color(red: 0.051, green: 0.580, blue: 0.533))
                        .clipShape(Capsule())
                }
                .padding(.horizontal, 16)
                .padding(.vertical, 10)
                .background(Color(red: 0.051, green: 0.580, blue: 0.533).opacity(0.08))
                .overlay(
                    Rectangle()
                        .frame(height: 1)
                        .foregroundColor(Color(red: 0.051, green: 0.580, blue: 0.533).opacity(0.2)),
                    alignment: .bottom
                )
            }
            .buttonStyle(.plain)
        }
    }

6b. Add ProUpgradeStrip to DashboardView.swift

    In DashboardView.body, find the outermost VStack or ScrollView that
    contains the main dashboard content. Add ProUpgradeStrip as the FIRST
    element (above the KPI cards / scroll content), but only for free users:

      if !subscriptionManager.isPro {
          ProUpgradeStrip {
              // Notify parent to show paywall
              NotificationCenter.default.post(
                  name: NSNotification.Name("stoqly.showPaywall"),
                  object: nil
              )
          }
      }

    Place it so it appears just below the navigation header, above the
